# RAPAT DIREKSI
BOARD OF DIRECTORS MEETING

## Kebijakan Rapat
Direksi wajib menyelenggarakan rapat internal paling sedikit 1 kali dalam 1 bulan, rapat gabungan bersama Dewan Komisaris paling sedikit 1 kali dalam 4 bulan, dan menghadiri pelaksanaan RUPS Tahunan maupun Luar Biasa.

## Pelaksanaan Rapat
Sepanjang tahun 2024, Direksi telah melaksanakan 4 kali rapat internal dan 1 kali rapat gabungan dengan Dewan Komisaris. Informasi terkait tingkat kehadiran rapat Direksi diuraikan sebagai berikut:

1. Conducting and responsible for the management of the Company for the Company's benefit in accordance with the Company's purposes and objectives;
2. Organizing Annual GMS and other GMS;
3. Performing duties and responsibilities in good faith, with full responsibility, and in a prudential manner;
4. In order to support the effectiveness of implementation of duties and responsibilities, the Board of Directors may form a committee;
5. Evaluating the performance of committees established at the end of each financial year;
6. Managing the Company in accordance with its authorities and responsibilities;
7. Managing the Company's assets;
8. Implementing risk management and GCG principles in every business activity of the Company;
9. Preparing an annual work plan; and
10. Establishing the organization structure and work procedures of the Company.

## Meeting Policy
Board of Directors is required to hold internal meeting at least once a month, joint meetings with the Board of Commissioners at least once in 4 months, and attend the Annual and Extraordinary GMS.

